price trends\n  - Cancel booking functionality\n\n- **Explore Page** - Discovery/deals page\n  - Interactive destination map\n  - Flexible dates grid with color-coded pricing\n  - Deals section\n\n**UI/UX Requirements:**\n- Blue/white color scheme (Google Material Design inspired)\n- Primary color: #1A73E8 (Google Blue)\n- Background: #F8F9FA (light gray)\n- Card backgrounds: white with subtle shadows\n- Text: #202124 (dark gray) primary, #5F6368 secondary\n- Responsive desktop layout\n- Collapsible navigation sidebar\n- All elements require data-testid attributes\n\n**Database Schema:**\nThe spec includes a complete database schema with tables for:\n- airports\n- airlines\n- flights\n- flight_legs\n- prices\n- sessions\n- recent_searches\n- bookings\n- booking_passengers\n- tracked_routes\n\n**Seed Data:**\n- ~50 major international airports\n- ~20 airlines\n- ~200 flights with realistic routes\n- Multiple legs for connecting flights\n- Sample bookings and tracked routes\n\n### 2. Test Specification (tests.md)\n\nComprehensive test specifications organized by page and component:\n\n**Search Page Tests:**\n- TripTypeSelector (7 tests)\n- PassengerCountSelector (7 tests)\n- CabinClassSelector (8 tests)\n- AirportAutocomplete (10 tests)\n- DatePicker (10 tests)\n- SearchButton (7 tests)\n- RecentSearches (6 tests)\n- PopularDestinations (5 tests)\n\n**Search Results Page Tests:**\n- SearchSummaryBar (9 tests)\n- FilterSidebar (16 tests)\n- FlightResultCard (12 tests)\n- TrackPricesToggle (6 tests)\n- Pagination (multiple tests)\n\n**Flight Details/Booking Page Tests:**\n- FlightSummary\n- PriceBreakdown\n- PassengerForm\n- BookingAction\n\n**My Trips Page Tests:**\n- TripsTabs (multi-tab navigation)\n- TripCard (12+ tests)\n- TrackedRouteCard (10+ tests)\n- CancelBookingModal (9 tests)\n\n**Explore Page Tests:**\n- DestinationMap (10 tests)\n- FlexibleDatesGrid (12 tests)\n- DealsSection (10 tests)\n\nTotal: 1,413 lines covering 80+ individual test scenarios with detailed initial states, actions, and expected outcomes.\n\n### 3. Build Progress\n\nBased on the tasks file (`/repo/tasks/tasks-app-building-vdaqap.json`), the app building process is organized into:\n- **Queued Tasks:** 10 major tasks involving writing components for 5 pages\n- **Current Task:** Writing Search page components (Sidebar, TripTypeSelector, PassengerCountSelector, CabinClassSelector, AirportAutocomplete, DatePicker, SearchButton, RecentSearches, PopularDestinations, PageSearch)\n\n### Key Findings\n\n1. **No Implementation Files Exist Yet** - The apps/GoogleFlights directory contains only specification documents, no actual source code (no src/, no .tsx, .ts files, no package.json)\n\n2. **Comprehensive Documentation** - The specification and tests are thoroughly detailed with specific UI requirements, data models, and expected behaviors\n\n3. **5 Major Pages Planned** - Search, Results, Booking, My Trips, Explore\n\n4. **Modular Component Architecture** - Design follows React best practices with ~30+ distinct components\n\n5. **Database-Driven** - Requires backend database with detailed schema for flights, bookings, and tracking\n\n6. **Modern Design System** - Google-inspired Material Design with specific color values and responsive layout requirements\n\n### No Additional Files Found\n\n- No AppStyle.md separate file exists (styling is embedded in AppSpec.md)\n- No AppRevisions.md history file\n- No shared app code directory or files\n- No implementation files, configuration files, or package management files yet\n\n---\n\n**Absolute File Paths:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/AppSpec.md`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a22a153a27b064a94 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 56187\ntool_uses: 51\nduration_ms: 62795</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83b6a70-0e11-4c8e-bdc4-82e0f5b3de96","uuid":"b759134e-8844-4e78-8459-cb9e124b1fef","tool_use_result":{"