d**: The bar displays origin \"LAX\", destination \"JFK\", dates \"Mar 25 – Apr 1\", \"1 adult\", and \"Economy\" inline. Each parameter is visually distinct and clickable.\n   431→   431→\n   432→   432→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit origin airport\n   433→   433→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, AirportAutocomplete\n   434→   434→- **Initial state**: Results page showing LAX → JFK search\n   435→   435→- **Action**: User clicks the origin parameter (\"LAX\") in the summary bar\n   436→   436→- **Expected**: An inline editor opens with an airport autocomplete field pre-filled with \"LAX\". User types \"SFO\", selects \"San Francisco International Airport (SFO)\" from suggestions, and confirms. The search re-executes with SFO → JFK and results update.\n   437→   437→\n   438→   438→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit destination airport\n   439→   439→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, AirportAutocomplete\n   440→   440→- **Initial state**: Results page showing LAX → JFK search\n   441→   441→- **Action**: User clicks the destination parameter (\"JFK\") in the summary bar\n   442→   442→- **Expected**: An inline editor opens with an airport autocomplete field pre-filled with \"JFK\". User types \"ORD\", selects \"O'Hare International Airport (ORD)\" from suggestions, and confirms. The search re-executes with LAX → ORD and results update.\n   443→   443→\n   444→   444→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit departure date\n   445→   445→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, DatePicker\n   446→   446→- **Initial state**: Results page showing search with departure Mar 25\n   447→   447→- **Action**: User clicks the departure date parameter in the summary bar\n   448→   448→- **Expected**: A date picker opens with Mar 25 selected. User selects Mar 28. The search re-executes with the new departure date and results update.\n   449→   449→\n   450→   450→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit return date\n   451→   451→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, DatePicker\n   452→   452→- **Initial state**: Results page showing round trip search with return Apr 1\n   453→   453→- **Action**: User clicks the return date parameter in the summary bar\n   454→   454→- **Expected**: A date picker opens with Apr 1 selected. User selects Apr 5. The search re-executes with the new return date and results update.\n   455→   455→\n   456→   456→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit passengers\n   457→   457→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, PassengerCountSelector\n   458→   458→- **Initial state**: Results page showing search with 1 adult\n   459→   459→- **Action**: User clicks the passenger count parameter in the summary bar\n   460→   460→- **Expected**: A passenger selector dropdown opens showing Adults: 1, Children: 0, Infants: 0. User increments adults to 2 and closes. The search re-executes with 2 adults and results update with new pricing.\n   461→   461→\n   462→   462→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit cabin class\n   463→   463→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, CabinClassSelector\n   464→   464→- **Initial state**: Results page showing Economy search\n   465→   465→- **Action**: User clicks the cabin class parameter in the summary bar\n   466→   466→- **Expected**: A dropdown opens showing Economy, Premium Economy, Business, First. User selects \"Business\". The search re-executes with Business class and results update with new pricing.\n   467→   467→\n   468→   468→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline editor closes without changes on outside click\n   469→   469→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n   470→   470→- **Initial state**: User has clicked the origin parameter and the inline editor is open\n   471→   471→- **Action**: User clicks outside the inline editor\n   472→   472→- **Expected**: The inline editor closes. The original search parameters are unchanged. No re-search occurs.\n   473→   473→\n   474→   474→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar can be edited multiple times in sequence\n   475→   475→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n   476→   476→- **Initial state**: Results page showing LAX → JFK search\n   477→   477→- **Action**: User edits origin to SFO (results update), then edits cabin class to Business (results update again)\n   478→   478→- **Expected**: Each edit triggers a new search. The summary bar reflects all changes: SFO → JFK, Business. Results correspond to the updated parameters.\n   479→   479→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e83b6a70-0e11-4c8e-bdc4-82e0f5b3de96","uuid":"9adbd2d4-b229-4d36-ae50-fd5034f308a2","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/agent/.claude/projects/-repo/e83b6a70-0e11-4c8e-bdc4-82e0f5b3de96/tool-results/toolu_01C33BD5QWv1wgsVbrtL22pM.txt","content":"   400→- **Action**: User clicks on a destination card (e.g., \"Tokyo, Japan\")\n   401→- **Expected**: The destination field is populated with the corresponding airport. A search is initiated to that destination (the origin may use a default or prompt the user to enter one).\n   402→\n   403→#### Test: PopularDestinations displays multiple cards in grid layout\n   404→- **Components**: PopularDestinations\n   405→- **Initial state**: Search page loads\n   406→- **Action**: User observes the popular destinations section\n   407→- **Expected**: Multiple destination cards are displayed in a responsive grid layout (e.g., 3-4 cards per row on desktop).\n   408→\n   409→#### Test: PopularDestinations cards have hover effect\n   410→- **Components**: PopularDestinations\n   411→- **Initial state**: Popular destinations section is visible\n   412→- **Action**: User hovers over a destination card\n   413→- **Expected**: The card shows a visual hover effect (e.g., shadow increase, slight scale, or color change) indicating it is interactive/clickable.\n   414→\n   415→## Page: Search Results\n   416→\n   417→### Components\n   418→- SearchSummaryBar\n   419→- FilterSidebar\n   420→- FlightResultCard\n   421→- TrackPricesToggle\n   422→- Pagination\n   423→\n   424→### SearchSummaryBar\n   425→\n   426→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar displays search parameters after search\n   427→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n   428→- **Initial state**: User searched LAX → JFK, Mar 25 – Apr 1, 1 adult, Economy, Round trip\n   429→- **Action**: User observes the summary bar at the top of the results page\n   430→- **Expected**: The bar displays origin \"LAX\", destination \"JFK\", dates \"Mar 25 – Apr 1\", \"1 adult\", and \"Economy\" inline. Each parameter is visually distinct and clickable.\n   431→\n   432→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit origin airport\n   433→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, AirportAutocomplete\n   434→- **Initial state**: Results page showing LAX → JFK search\n   435→- **Action**: User clicks the origin parameter (\"LAX\") in the summary bar\n   436→- **Expected**: An inline editor opens with an airport autocomplete field pre-filled with \"LAX\". User types \"SFO\", selects \"San Francisco International Airport (SFO)\" from suggestions, and confirms. The search re-executes with SFO → JFK and results update.\n   437→\n   438→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit destination airport\n   439→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, AirportAutocomplete\n   440→- **Initial state**: Results page showing LAX → JFK search\n   441→- **Action**: User clicks the destination parameter (\"JFK\") in the summary bar\n   442→- **Expected**: An inline editor opens with an airport autocomplete field pre-filled with \"JFK\". User types \"ORD\", selects \"O'Hare International Airport (ORD)\" from suggestions, and confirms. The search re-executes with LAX → ORD and results update.\n   443→\n   444→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit departure date\n   445→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, DatePicker\n   446→- **Initial state**: Results page showing search with departure Mar 25\n   447→- **Action**: User clicks the departure date parameter in the summary bar\n   448→- **Expected**: A date picker opens with Mar 25 selected. User selects Mar 28. The search re-executes with the new departure date and results update.\n   449→\n   450→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit return date\n   451→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, DatePicker\n   452→- **Initial state**: Results page showing round trip search with return Apr 1\n   453→- **Action**: User clicks the return date parameter in the summary bar\n   454→- **Expected**: A date picker opens with Apr 1 selected. User selects Apr 5. The search re-executes with the new return date and results update.\n   455→\n   456→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit passengers\n   457→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, PassengerCountSelector\n   458→- **Initial state**: Results page showing search with 1 adult\n   459→- **Action**: User clicks the passenger count parameter in the summary bar\n   460→- **Expected**: A passenger selector dropdown opens showing Adults: 1, Children: 0, Infants: 0. User increments adults to 2 and closes. The search re-executes with 2 adults and results update with new pricing.\n   461→\n   462→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit cabin class\n   463→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, CabinClassSelector\n   464→- **Initial state**: Results page showing Economy search\n   465→- **Action**: User clicks the cabin class parameter in the summary bar\n   466→- **Expected**: A dropdown opens showing Economy, Premium Economy, Business, First. User selects \"Business\". The search re-executes with Business class and results update with new pricing.\n   467→\n   468→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline editor closes without changes on outside click\n   469→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n   470→- **Initial state**: User has clicked the origin parameter and the inline editor is open\n   471→- **Action**: User clicks outside the inline editor\n   472→- **Expected**: The inline editor closes. The original search parameters are unchanged. No re-search occurs.\n   473→\n   474→#### Test: SearchSummaryBar can be edited multiple times in sequence\n   475→- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n   476→- **Initial state**: Results page showing LAX → JFK search\n   477→- **Action**: User edits origin to SFO (results update), then edits cabin class to Business (results update again)\n   478→- **Expected**: Each edit triggers a new search. The summary bar reflects all changes: SFO → JFK, Business. Results correspond to the updated parameters.\n   479→","numLines":80,"startLine":400,"totalLines":1414}}}
