[2026-03-14T18:50:09.789Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01J2QPqk2NesBucHAVqt9jrB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 subtasks are complete:\n\n1. **WriteComponentSidebar** - Collapsible navigation sidebar with icons for Search, Explore, My Trips. Supports expanded/collapsed states with toggle button.\n\n2. **WriteComponentTripTypeSelector** - Custom dropdown (not native select) with Round trip, One way, Multi-city options. Closes on outside click, updates Redux state.\n\n3. **WriteComponentPassengerCountSelector** - Dropdown with Adults/Children/Infants categories, +/- controls, min 1 adult, infants capped at adult count.\n\n4. **WriteComponentCabinClassSelector** - Custom dropdown with Economy, Premium Economy, Business, First options. Closes on outside click.\n\n5. **WriteComponentAirportAutocomplete** - Autocomplete text input searching airports by name, city, or IATA code via `/api/airports`. Shows suggestions with airport name and code. Includes swap button support.\n\n6. **WriteComponentDatePicker** - Calendar date picker with month navigation, disabled past dates, min-date support for return date, and proper date formatting.\n\n7. **WriteComponentSearchButton** - Validates all required fields, saves recent search to database, navigates to results page with search params.\n\n8. **WriteComponentRecentSearches** - Fetches recent searches per session, displays route/dates/passengers, clicking re-populates form and navigates to results.\n\n9. **WriteComponentPopularDestinations** - Grid of destination cards with gradient images, city/country/price info. Clicking initiates search to that destination.\n\n10. **WritePageSearch** - Assembles all components into the search page with hero section, form card, recent searches, and popular destinations below.\n\nAdditionally set up: app scaffolding, Neon database with schema and seed data, Redux store, 5 Netlify functions, ESLint config, and Pl